Stream Vote uses a dating app style swiper to help you and your friends group or a cheeky facetime date to pick a movie to watch. 

•	Host a group and send your friends the invitation code to join your group;
•	Pick a Streaming Service;
•	Choose what genre Movies or TV-Shows you want to swipe;
•	Swipe Right for Liked and Left for Pass;
•	Depending on the group size the movie with the most matches will be the one you watch;
